  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 'Appears on all reels. Substitutes for all


      symbols except              ,               and'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: 'Any 4 consecutive Scatters from leftmost reel awards 5 Free Games.

      Enjoy wins with up to 60 Free Games!



      Any triggering                 becomes sticky wild till the end of Free Games.

      The bet during Free Games is the same as in the spin that triggered Free Games.

      Free Games can be re-triggered the same as in Base Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "There is a progression bar to fill with certain symbol to trigger Golden
      Tiki Free Games.\n\n\nEach                contributes to the progression bar.\nWhen
      progression is complete, Golden Tiki Free Games starts.\n\n\nNo                and
      \                             symbols appear during Golden Tiki Free Games.\nThere
      are 4 stops on progression bar. \nEach stop awards 5 more Free Games.\nThe farther
      the stop you reach, the greater the reward you win.\nPlayer receives only the
      highest reward from the stops passed."
